  "ratchetRule":"ICTC 1.2 Semantic Closure uses one canonical business procedure registry, adapter-derived generic layers, append semantic history and one deterministic projection basis across seven process-specific procedures. AI remains proposal-only; catalogue provenance, organizational standard use, requirement applicability, coverage mapping and control effectiveness remain distinct epistemic statements; version/evidence identity never upgrades itself into compliance.",
